@startuml uc-end-of-day-cashup
title UC: End-of-Day Cash-Up / Z-Report
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #0F172A
  ActorBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #0F172A
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  NoteBackgroundColor #FEF9C3
  NoteBorderColor #CA8A04
}

actor "Cashier / Manager" as User
participant "POS System" as System

User -> System : open Cash-up (till, businessDate)
System -> System : aggregate sales, cash/card/mobile-money\nbreakdown, refunds, expected cash
System --> User : expected cash breakdown

User -> System : submit countedCash, notes
System -> System : recompute expected total server-side\n(never trusts a client-sent figure)
System -> System : persist cash_ups row + audit_log entry
System --> User : variance, cash-up recorded

note over System
  Expected cash assumes any refund on this
  till was paid out of the cash drawer —
  a refund settled back to card/mobile-money
  understates expected cash (known simplification).
end note

== Exceptions ==
alt non-zero variance
  System --> User : recorded, not blocked (shortfall/overage saved as-is)
end
alt multiple cash-ups same day (shift handover)
  System --> User : allowed, each submission is its own history row
end
@enduml
